    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"feelings\" tho. i mean it literally. i walk into a room and people just... they act like i'm not even there. or they look at me with this pity that feels worse than hate. it’s like i’ve been erased. there is no \"finding my way back\" when the world has already decided i don't exist anymore. there's nothing left to go back to.",
